# New/renormalized text files are LF in the repo and on checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-exact preserves (override the rule above):
# - shared input CSVs (SHAs are pinned in data/README.md)
# - the entire v1 archive, whose MANIFEST_SHA256.txt must verify in any clone
# - the autumn 2026 research archive, whose studies pinned their original bytes
data/*.csv -text
archive/v1/** -text
archive/2026_autumn_research/** -text
archive/2026_autumn_research/**/*.xmind binary
